	<section_number>54.1-3906</section_number>
	<catch_line>Liability to client</catch_line>
	<text>
		Every attorney shall be liable to his client for any damage sustained by the client through the neglect of his duty as such attorney.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 54-46; 1988, c. 765; 2011, c. 703.</history>
</law>
